### 1. Ingest Normal Typing Event (Clean)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/proctor/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "eventType": "TAB_FOCUS",
  "metadataDetails": "Candidate focused on interview room"
}

### 2. Ingest Suspicious Tab Blur Event (Candidate away for 12 seconds)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/proctor/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "eventType": "TAB_BLUR",
  "durationSeconds": 12,
  "metadataDetails": "Window lost focus"
}

### 3. Ingest Instant Code Paste Dump (350 characters pasted in 10ms)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/proctor/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "eventType": "PASTE_DUMP",
  "characterCount": 350,
  "metadataDetails": "Pasted full DFS solution into code editor"
}

### 4. Fetch Calculated Integrity Summary & Scorecard for Session 1
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/proctor/session/1/summary

###
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/proctor/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "eventType": "TAB_FOCUS",
  "metadataDetails": "Candidate focused on interview room"
